From 705d1711cc054f12d66c822d06aa4d961c071d45 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: William Floyd <git@notmy.space>
Date: Fri, 25 Sep 2026 17:07:23 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] wwan: Restore the APN dialog header bar

Since the port to AdwDialog the header bar sits in the [titlebar] slot,
which AdwDialog doesn't have, so Back, Add and Save are not shown: APNs
can't be added, and edits can't be saved.

Put the content in an AdwToolbarView with the header bar on top, as the
details dialog does. While at it, finish the port for closing: set
can-close to false so that the device page's close-attempt handler,
which force-closes the dialog, runs on every close as the unmap handler
did before, and close the dialog from Back instead of hiding it.
